    "content_id": "58c83be0-6264-4cb0-a652-126d57e8c0b7",
    "details": {
     "access_and_opening_times": "<div class=\"govspeak\"><h2 id=\"opening-hours\">Opening hours</h2>\n\n<p>British Embassy opening hours: Monday to Friday, 8:30am to 5pm</p>\n\n<p>The British Consulate General in Madrid is open by appointment only.</p>\n\n<p>To call us in an emergency or send us an online enquiry <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.contact.service.csd.fcdo.gov.uk/posts/spain/british-embassy-madrid\">use our contact form</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"public-holidays\">2026 public holidays</h2>\n\n<p>Our offices will be closed for the following public holidays in 2026:</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday 1 January</td>\n      <td>New Year’s Day</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday 6 January</td>\n      <td>Epiphany</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday 2 April</td>\n      <td>Maundy Thursday</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday 3 April</td>\n      <td>Good Friday</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday 6 April</td>\n      <td>Easter Monday</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday 1 May</td>\n      <td>Labour Day</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday 15 May</td>\n      <td>San Isidro</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday 12 October</td>\n      <td>Fiesta Nacional de España</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday 2 November</td>\n      <td>All Saints Day (in lieu of Sun 1 Nov)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday 9 November</td>\n      <td>La Almudena</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday 7 December</td>\n      <td>Día de la Constitución Española (in lieu of Sun 6 Dec)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday 8 December</td>\n      <td>Inmaculada Concepcion</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday 25 December</td>\n      <td>Christmas Day</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday 28 December</td>\n      <td>UK Boxing Day</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n</div>"
